ry","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp52uu7c0atssljxht55azd0","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-irj0aw","name":"X：小米 MiMo (@XiaomiMiMo)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"MiMo V2.5 Pro 在 @DesignArena 上刚刚获得第三名！🎉 MiMo V2.5 Pro (Thinking) 在总排行榜上比 MiMo-V2.5 提升了 8 个名次，在前端编码任务中达到与 Claude Sonnet 4.6 相同的性能水平。 衷心祝贺 @XiaomiMiMo 团队取得这些进步！","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4x0njy09hysljxynnj3omy","title":"NousResearch推出Token Superposition Training技术，显著加速大语言模型预训练","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp4x0njy09hysljxynnj3omy","https://x.com/SiliconFlowAI/status/2054755824309076359"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp4x0njy09hysljxynnj3omy","title":"NousResearch推出Token Superposition Training技术，显著加速大语言模型预训练","originalTitle":"","summary":"NousResearch发布了Token Superposition Training（TST），这是一种改进标准大语言模型预训练流程的方法。该技术无需改变模型架构、优化器、分词器或训练数据，即可在相同计算量（FLOPs）下实现2-3倍的训练时间加速。其核心是在训练的前三分之一阶段，让模型读取并预测连续的token包，对输入嵌入进行平均，并使用改进的交叉熵损失预测下一个token包；剩余训练时间则恢复为标准的下一个token预测。推理阶段的模型与传统预训练产生的模型完全相同。该方法已在270M、600M、3B的密集模型以及10B至1B的混合专家模型规模上得到验证。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4x0njy09hysljxynnj3omy","originalUrl":"https://x.com/SiliconFlowAI/status/2054755824309076359","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1bkpcx","originalSourceName":"X：硅基流动 SiliconFlow (@SiliconFlowAI)","family":"outlet-e5au5q","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4x0njy09hysljxynnj3omy","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1bkpcx","name":"X：硅基流动 SiliconFlow (@SiliconFlowAI)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"NousResearch发布了Token Superposition Training（TST），这是一种改进标准大语言模型预训练流程的方法。该技术无需改变模型架构、优化器、分词器或训练数据，即可在相同计算量（FLOPs）下实现2-3倍的训练时间加速。其核心是在训练的前三分之一阶段，让模型读取并预测连续的token包，对输入嵌入进行平均，并使用改进的交叉熵损失预测下一个token包；剩余训练时间则恢复为标准的下一个token预测。推理阶段的模型与传统预训练产生的模型完全相同。该方法已在270M、600M、3B的密集模型以及10B至1B的混合专家模型规模上得到验证。","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4yeqnn09sksljxvgbqhxp4","title":"教视觉-语言模型说“电影语言”","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp4yeqnn09sksljxvgbqhxp4","https://blog.ml.cmu.edu/2026/05/13/teaching-vision-language-models-to-speak-cinema"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp4yeqnn09sksljxvgbqhxp4","title":"教视觉-语言模型说“电影语言”","originalTitle":"","summary":"研究团队与百余名专业创作者历时一年，构建了一个视频描述生成流程，其核心在于扩展精细化的人类-AI协同监督，而非单纯扩大模型规模。该研究（入选CVPR 2026亮点论文）指出，当前主流视频生成模型在理解和生成具有电影感的专业运镜（如希区柯克式滑动变焦、精确的焦点转移或荷兰角镜头）时存在明显不足，常产出通用或焦点错误的画面。这项工作揭示了一条通过提升监督质量来增强模型“电影语言”表达能力的新路径。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4yeqnn09sksljxvgbqhxp4","originalUrl":"https://blog.ml.cmu.edu/2026/05/13/teaching-vision-language-models-to-speak-cinema","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-7kwn3t","originalSourceName":"CMU：Machine Learning Blog","family":"outlet-xyda4d","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4yeqnn09sksljxvgbqhxp4","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-7kwn3t","name":"CMU：Machine Learning Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"研究团队与百余名专业创作者历时一年，构建了一个视频描述生成流程，其核心在于扩展精细化的人类-AI协同监督，而非单纯扩大模型规模。该研究（入选CVPR 2026亮点论文）指出，当前主流视频生成模型在理解和生成具有电影感的专业运镜（如希区柯克式滑动变焦、精确的焦点转移或荷兰角镜头）时存在明显不足，常产出通用或焦点错误的画面。这项工作揭示了一条通过提升监督质量来增强模型“电影语言”表达能力的新路径。","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk50gxfsljxvr8lea5f","title":"创始人手册：构建AI原生初创公司","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk50gxfsljxvr8lea5f","https://claude.com/blog/the-founders-playbook"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp5snpk50gxfsljxvr8lea5f","title":"创始人手册：构建AI原生初创公司","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic公司发布了一份面向AI原生初创企业的实用指南，旨在重塑2026年创业生命周期的构思、最小可行产品、发布和规模化四个核心阶段。该手册为每个阶段提供了具体目标、退出标准、常见失败模式及AI驱动练习，涵盖如何利用Claude进行问题验证与客户发现、避免AI生成代码的技术债务、区分真实产品市场契合度与早期炒作，并引入智能工作流替代创始人手动操作。指南还整合了多家初创企业的实践案例，为从零开始围绕AI构建公司的创始人提供架构、范围与安全方面的最佳实践。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk50gxfsljxvr8lea5f","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/the-founders-playbook","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk50gxfsljxvr8lea5f","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Anthropic公司发布了一份面向AI原生初创企业的实用指南，旨在重塑2026年创业生命周期的构思、最小可行产品、发布和规模化四个核心阶段。该手册为每个阶段提供了具体目标、退出标准、常见失败模式及AI驱动练习，涵盖如何利用Claude进行问题验证与客户发现、避免AI生成代码的技术债务、区分真实产品市场契合度与早期炒作，并引入智能工作流替代创始人手动操作。指南还整合了多家初创企业的实践案例，为从零开始围绕AI构建公司的创始人提供架构、范围与安全方面的最佳实践。","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp56ia350bpmsljxpdssx3w0","title":"“让 Token 消耗降低 61%”：腾讯开源 Agent Memory","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp56ia350bpmsljxpdssx3w0","https://www.ithome.com/0/950/415.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp56ia350bpmsljxpdssx3w0","title":"“让 Token 消耗降低 61%”：腾讯开源 Agent Memory","originalTitle":"","summary":"腾讯云开源了TencentDB Agent Memory，旨在解决Agent长任务中上下文窗口易满、Token成本高的问题。该方案采用“上下文卸载”与“Mermaid任务画布”两项核心技术，将完整信息卸载至外部存储，同时用结构化任务图保留关键状态与执行路径。实验显示，该方案在多任务连续会话中最高可降低61%的Token消耗，并提升任务成功率。项目已适配OpenClaw等主流框架，支持一键集成与本地SQLite存储。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp56ia350bpmsljxpdssx3w0","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/950/415.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp56ia350bpmsljxpdssx3w0","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"腾讯云开源了TencentDB Agent Memory，旨在解决Agent长任务中上下文窗口易满、Token成本高的问题。该方案采用“上下文卸载”与“Mermaid任务画布”两项核心技术，将完整信息卸载至外部存储，同时用结构化任务图保留关键状态与执行路径。实验显示，该方案在多任务连续会话中最高可降低61%的Token消耗，并提升任务成功率。项目已适配OpenClaw等主流框架，支持一键集成与本地SQLite存储。","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk60gxgsljxszwrxmln","title":"在大型代码库中高效运用Claude Code：最佳实践与入门指南","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk60gxgsljxszwrxmln","https://claude.com/blog/how-claude-code-works-in-large-codebases-best-practices-and-where-to-start"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp5snpk60gxgsljxszwrxmln","title":"在大型代码库中高效运用Claude Code：最佳实践与入门指南","originalTitle":"","summary":"Claude Code已成功部署于数百万行的单体仓库、遗留系统及分布式架构中。其核心在于围绕模型构建的“工具套件”，而非仅依赖模型本身。该套件包含五个关键扩展点：提供代码库概览的CLAUDE.md文件、实现持续改进的钩子、按需加载专业知识的技能、插件以及MCP服务器。它采用智能体搜索模式，直接在开发者本地实时代码库上操作，无需构建和维护集中式索引，从而避免了传统RAG系统在活跃大型代码库中索引过时的问题。团队对代码库设置的投入程度直接决定了其导航效果。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk60gxgsljxszwrxmln","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/how-claude-code-works-in-large-codebases-best-practices-and-where-to-start","publishedAt":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp5snpk60gxgsljxszwrxmln","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Claude Code已成功部署于数百万行的单体仓库、遗留系统及分布式架构中。其核心在于围绕模型构建的“工具套件”，而非仅依赖模型本身。该套件包含五个关键扩展点：提供代码库概览的CLAUDE.md文件、实现持续改进的钩子、按需加载专业知识的技能、插件以及MCP服务器。它采用智能体搜索模式，直接在开发者本地实时代码库上操作，无需构建和维护集中式索引，从而避免了传统RAG系统在活跃大型代码库中索引过时的问题。团队对代码库设置的投入程度直接决定了其导航效果。","reportEdition":"2026-05-15","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":20,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":17,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":4},{"topic":"应用","count":7},{"topic":"行业","count":4},{"topic":"研究","count":2},{"topic":"开发","count":3}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
